    "lists": {
      "ordered": [
        {
          "text": "**Workflow Name:** A clear, concise title.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 27,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Purpose/Goal:** A one-sentence explanation of *why* this workflow exists. What is the desired outcome?",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 30,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Trigger:** What event kicks off this workflow?",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 32,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Required Tools:** List the specific plugins, templates, or external tools needed.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 34,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Step-by-Step Instructions:** The core of the SOP. This should be a numbered list of discrete, actionable steps. Each step should be a clear command.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 36,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Expected Outcome:** Describe what the end result looks like. You can even include a screenshot or a code block showing the final Markdown file.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 42,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Principle of Distinct Note Types:** I firmly believe that not all notes are created equal. A fleeting thought, a detailed meeting summary, and a permanent, atomic Zettelkasten note serve fundamentally different purposes and should be treated differently from the moment of their creation.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 87,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Principle of Minimal Cognitive Load:** The most effective workflow is the one that requires the least amount of active thought to execute. The goal is to make the process feel like an extension of your own mind, not a piece of software you have to operate.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 89,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Principle of Future Utility:** Every piece of information should be captured in a way that makes it maximally useful for my \"future self.\" This means structured data (YAML frontmatter) is non-negotiable, as it powers the Dataview queries that will connect ideas later.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 90,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Press `Ctrl+N`.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 118,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "A **QuickAdd Suggester** menu appears on screen with the question: \"**What kind of note are you creating?**\" The options are:",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 120,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Select an option using the arrow keys or by typing the corresponding letter (e.g., 'S') and press `Enter`.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 126,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Based on the choice, a specific **Templater** template is executed, which may include further prompts.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 127,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "The new note is automatically created in the correct folder, with a standardized file name, and populated with a structured template.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 128,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        }
      ],
      "unordered": [
        {
          "text": "*Example:* `SOP-001: New Fleeting Note Capture`",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 29,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "*Example:* To capture a transient idea with minimal friction and tag it for later processing.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 31,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "*Example:* A keyboard shortcut (`Ctrl+Alt+F`), or clicking a button on the Homepage.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 33,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "*Example:* `QuickAdd` plugin, `Templater` plugin, `tpl-fleeting-note.md` template file.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 35,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. Press `Ctrl+Alt+F`.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 37,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "2. A QuickAdd input box appears asking for \"Your fleeting thought?\".",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 38,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "3. Type the thought and press `Enter`.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 39,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "4. A new note is created in the `01_Fleeting/` folder with the current date and time as the title.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 40,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "5. The note content is pre-filled with the thought and tagged `#status/fleeting`.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 41,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "*Example:* A new file named `01_Fleeting/2025-10-01-1430.md` is created with the following content...",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 43,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I copy the URL. I open Obsidian. I think about what folder to put it in. I create a new note. I paste the URL. I write my thoughts...\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 56,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "*Pain Point:* \"Thinking about the folder.\" -> *Opportunity:* Automate file location.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 61,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "*Pain Point:* \"Creating the note and pasting the link.\" -> *Opportunity:* Use a template to format it automatically.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 62,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "*Pain Point:* \"Forgetting to add tags.\" -> *Opportunity:* The template can add default tags.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 63,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The trigger will be a **QuickAdd** Capture choice with a hotkey.\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 67,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It will prompt me for the URL.\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 68,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It will run a **Templater** template.\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 69,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The template will create the note in the `Sources/Articles` folder, name the file based on the date, and insert the URL and a 'My Thoughts' heading.\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 70,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**QuickAdd:** To create the master menu (Suggester).",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 111,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Templater:** To generate the content and logic for each note type.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 112,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Dataview:** To be leveraged by the metadata created in the templates.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 113,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "`[F] Fleeting Note` (For quick, undeveloped ideas)",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 121,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "`[M] Meeting Note` (For structured meeting minutes)",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 122,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "`[S] Source Note` (For literature notes on articles, books, videos)",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 123,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "`[P] Permanent Note` (For atomic, Zettelkasten-style notes)",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 124,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "`[D] Daily Note` (For your daily journal entry)",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 125,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Choice `[F] Fleeting Note`:**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 135,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Action:** Runs `tpl-fleeting.md`.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 137,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Prompts:** Asks for your thought: `const thought = await tp.system.prompt(\"Fleeting thought:\");`",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 138,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**File Creation:** Creates a new note in `01_Fleeting/` with the filename `YYYY-MM-DD-HHmm_Fleeting.md`.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 139,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Content:** Inserts the thought and adds frontmatter like `type: fleeting` and `status: unprocessed`.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 140,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Choice `[M] Meeting Note`:**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 141,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Action:** Runs `tpl-meeting.md`.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 143,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Prompts:** Asks for \"Meeting Topic\", \"Attendees\", etc.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 144,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**File Creation:** Creates a note in `02_Meetings/` with the filename `YYYY-MM-DD_{{Meeting Topic}}.md`.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 145,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Content:** Structures the note with headers (`## Agenda`, `## Notes`, `## Action Items`) and populates the frontmatter with the prompted data.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 146,
          "source": "reference-guide-designing-optimal-workflows-&-sops-20251125160849.md"
